      "title": "How to use",
      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "## Image Edit\n\n1. Upload your reference image.\n2. Edit the prompt: say what to keep and what to change.\n3. Run and review Save Image.\n\nOne edited image is generated and saved.\n\nThe fixed seed allows unchanged runs to reuse cached outputs. Change the seed or prompt for new results.\n\nNeeds a ModelArk key in Settings > BytePlus."
